Package: scAllMeta
Type: Package
Title: Print Summary Tables for All Seurat Metadata Columns
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sedat", "Kacar", email = "sedatkacar56@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Prints a frequency table for every column in the metadata of a
    Seurat object in one call. Columns with many unique values, such as
    continuous quality metrics, are flagged as not applicable, and columns with
    a moderate number of values show only the most frequent entries.
